-exhaustion/'}, {'signal_id': 'dcc9dc46fac4c5ef', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Lessons for Pentagon Procurement from the Special Operations Enterprise <p>As the Pentagon races to buy hundreds of thousands of unmanned systems, acquisition professionals have turned to the special operations community to learn about how to buy commercial technologies fast. Car', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/lessons-for-pentagon-procurement-from-the-special-operations-enterprise/'}, {'signal_id': '33f895e0b5f20a33', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Importance of the Battle of Bailén <p>Early on the morning of July 16, 1808, Captain-General Francisco Javier Casta&#241;os of the Army of Andalusia launched a surprise attack against the divided forces of Emperor Napoleon Bonaparte&#8217;s Army of the Gironde. After three gr', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-importance-of-the-battle-of-bailen/'}, {'signal_id': 'ab06c2b99631c0f5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Deception in Mass Autonomous Warfare <p>&#8220;[T]he exigencies of desperate survival do stimulate wise leaders to seek such unorthodox solutions.&#8221; &#8212;Barton Whaley, StratagemOn the night of Jan. 5, 2025, my first mission in the Pokrovsk command post was to make a fake ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/deception-in-mass-autonomous-warfare/'}, {'signal_id': '79fd340aed19f8df', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Brothers in Arms, Partners in Healing: A Story about a Breakthrough in Treating Post-Traumatic Stress <p>After losing fellow marines in Iraq, Jeff Lindquist struggled with post-traumatic stress that was steadily destroying his life. Years later, an innovative technology helped hi', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/brothers-in-arms-partners-in-healing-a-story-about-a-breakthrough-in-treating-post-traumatic-stress/'}, {'signal_id': 'd1bf67c0447f1ea5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Endless Chip War <p>This exclusive Cogs of War interview is with Rakesh Kumar, the author of Chip Age: How Semiconductors Became the World&#8217;s Most Powerful Resource. Rakesh has worked as a co-founder, professor, researcher, and advisor in the chip industry for more than ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-endless-chip-war/'}, {'signal_id': 'e50c8cf946b256c0', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The West Is Thinking Too Small About Ukraine’s Victory <p>Since fall 2023, Ukraine&#8217;s supporters have fallen into a pattern: Ukrainians warn that Russia is targeting its energy infrastructure to prevent them from heating their homes, schools, and businesses in the coming win', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-west-is-thinking-too-small-about-ukraines-victory/'}, {'signal_id': '504789077c3e2db9', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Fighting in Ethiopia and the Risk of Regional Spillover <p>In September, fighting broke out in Ethiopia&#8217;s Tigray region between Ethiopian government forces and the Tigray People&#8217;s Liberation Front (TPLF), effectively collapsing the 2022 peace deal. In October, Ethiopi', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/fighting-in-ethiopia-and-the-risk-of-regional-spillover/'}, {'signal_id': '96067be01a3925c0', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Establishing Battery Supply Chain Resilience for Drones <p>Militaries have spent more than a century operating with fuel and ammunition as limits of combat endurance. They are only beginning to treat batteries with the same operational seriousness, as small unmanned systems move ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/establishing-battery-supply-chain-resilience-for-drones/'}, {'signal_id': '46c8ac1798543095', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Tehran is a Different Beast Now <p>The Tehran that the world knew is gone. It died in the fires with former Supreme Leader Ali Khamenei on the first day of the war in February. His son and new Supreme Leader, Mojtaba