y/'}, {'signal_id': 'e17b18b4e6f080a9', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'March Separately, Strike Combined: Rethinking Mass and Maneuver on the Transparent Battlefield <p>Between May 10 and 13, 1940, German Panzer Group Kleist advanced through the densely wooded Ardennes Forest, which the French considered impenetrable to large, mechanized formations.', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/march-separately-strike-combined-rethinking-mass-and-maneuver-on-the-transparent-battlefield/'}, {'signal_id': '3df0b9933c5c95ea', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'China’s Strategic Reassessment of India <p>As China and India have improved their relations in recent months, many observers have attributed this improvement to the end of U.S. strategic altruism toward India. Indeed, in the past year, China has watched India lose its balance and', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/chinas-strategic-reassessment-of-india/'}, {'signal_id': '617aa970b2e89f29', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Do the Benefits Outweigh the Risks of Hosting U.S. Military Bases? <p>Since the end of World War II, the United States has maintained hundreds of military installations abroad. While U.S. forces have faced some objections to their presence, many allies and partners have seen U.S.', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/do-the-benefits-outweigh-the-risks-of-hosting-u-s-military-bases/'}, {'signal_id': 'd5b6daf0837c1f71', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Golden Dome Is Technologically and Financially Infeasible <p>For as long as nuclear-armed, intercontinental ballistic missiles and submarine-launched ballistic missiles have existed, strategists and engineers have pursued a seductive idea: a shield effective enough to diminish &#', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/golden-dome-is-technologically-and-financially-infeasible/'}, {'signal_id': '385dbb7b1febdab2', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'How Sudan Became a Laboratory for Drone Warfare, Thanks to Abu Dhabi <p>In June 2026, I visited Khartoum, my hometown, for the first time since the war broke out in Sudan in April 2023. I left the city to seek safety with my family after the war spread into civilian neighborhoods', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/how-sudan-became-a-laboratory-for-drone-warfare-thanks-to-abu-dhabi/'}, {'signal_id': 'be056ebaa30940a5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'China’s Military Expansion in Southeast Asia Masks a More Complicated Reality <p>The Chinese Ministry of Defense&#8217;s announcement of a &#8220;joint support and training center&#8221; at an airport in Ban Keun, Laos, on Sept. 29 drew attention to the People&#8217;s Liberation ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/chinas-military-expansion-in-southeast-asia-masks-a-more-complicated-reality/'}, {'signal_id': 'c0b56a464ff0fa86', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Paradox of Victory: When Winning in Ukraine Raises the Nuclear Stakes <p>In 2022, Jeremy Shapiro warned in &#8220;We Are on a Path to Nuclear War&#8221; that the war between Russia and Ukraine was heading toward nuclear escalation. Four years into the war, we asked him to rev', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-paradox-of-victory-when-winning-in-ukraine-raises-the-nuclear-stakes/'}, {'signal_id': 'aaef8b51076309dd', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Mecca Pact and Pakistan’s Bid to Become Indispensable <p>For most of its history, Pakistan&#8217;s geopolitical value has risen and fallen with other countries&#8217; emergencies. The Mecca Pact may be its most serious attempt yet to break that cycle. On Aug. 31, Pakistan, Sa', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-mecca-pact-and-pakistans-bid-to-become-indispensable/'}, {'signal_id': 'a09f9210922c4317', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The United Kingdom’s Military AI Ambitions Need Guardrails <p>Advancing military AI capability is a priority for the United Kingdom, and in recent weeks, t