-of-war/ground-robots-are-arriving-on-the-front-lines/'}, {'signal_id': '97d6bef2c944be24', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'How China and America Can Move from Competition to Stability <p>The American team thought it was signaling restraint. The Chinese team saw preparations for combat. In a closed-door Sino-American crisis simulation I helped organize in the 2010s &#8212; which the U.S. military fund', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/how-china-and-america-can-move-from-competition-to-stability/'}, {'signal_id': '2142be6d8782effc', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Shows of Strength and Signs of Strain <p>Welcome to The Adversarial.&#160;Every other week, we&#8217;ll provide you with expert analysis on America&#8217;s greatest challengers: China, Russia, Iran, North Korea, and jihadists. Read more below.***IranIn late September, U.S. and Ir', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/shows-of-strength-and-signs-of-strain/'}, {'signal_id': 'fe074f4791904e96', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Last Mile of Pentagon Reform Runs Through the Brigade <p>A kill chain measured in seconds cannot depend on processes measured in weeks or months. The Pentagon recognizes that drone proliferation and AI-enabled lethal targeting are reducing decision cycles and increasing the p', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-last-mile-of-pentagon-reform-runs-through-the-brigade/'}, {'signal_id': '9e96443e4397e990', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Fornication in America: Trump’s Arch, Rome’s Emperors, and the Meaning of Victory <p>In 79 A.D., Gaius Plinius Secundus, known today as Pliny the Elder, was the supreme commander of the Roman imperial fleet, permanently stationed at Misenum near Naples. He died during the eruptio', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/fornication-in-america-trumps-arch-romes-emperors-and-the-meaning-of-victory/'}, {'signal_id': '37973df28de692e9', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Ten Wartime Technologies at America’s 250th <p>For America&#8217;s 250th anniversary, Cogs of War ran ten essays on innovations forged in wartime that subsequently diffused throughout the civilian economy, or had a lasting impact on society, governance, and Americans&#8217; relat', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/ten-wartime-technologies-at-americas-250th/'}, {'signal_id': '95001aa2838eec83', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Achieving Breakthrough: Maneuver Warfare in the Face of Robotic Mass <p>In 1914, European armies entered a war with forces designed to move. Within months, they were digging themselves into the earth. Fires from newly introduced machine guns and heavy artillery made movement acro', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/achieving-breakthrough-maneuver-warfare-in-the-face-of-robotic-mass/'}, {'signal_id': '331261e4ad7f06d4', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Atlantic Brief: U.S. and European Perspectives on Nuclear Deterrence <p>For this edition of The Atlantic Brief, the Royal United Services Institute and War on the Rocks&#160;present a dialogue on U.S. and European Perspectives on Nuclear Deterrence. Participating experts from', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-atlantic-brief-u-s-and-european-perspectives-on-nuclear-deterrence/'}, {'signal_id': '7921e76d296a7392', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Navy’s Missing Welders Are Stocking Shelves <p>The U.S. Navy&#8217;s May 2026 shipbuilding plan, signed by Acting Secretary of the Navy Hung Cao, uses the word &#8220;innovative&#8221; eight times. The plan applies that word, among other things, to the Columbia-class submarin', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-navys-missing-welders-are-stocking-shelves/'}, {'signal_id': '8c6201e96e6b306c', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'How to Defend Against AI-Designed Viruses <p>Anthropic recently disclosed five cases in which users hid their countries while asking Claude for help enhancing pathogens or toxins. This added fuel to the ongoing debate over whether progress in AI should be slowed. Insider warnings', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/how-to-defend-against-ai-designed-viruses/'}, {'signal_id': '3ca818d583ea279f', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Kindling, Catalyst, and Containment: Will the West Bank Ignite? <p>As violence by Israeli settlers against Palestinians in the West Bank has escalated, often with the acquiescence or support of Israel&#8217;s military, and the Israeli government has increasingly constricted Pales', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/kindling-catalyst-and-containment-will-the-west-bank-ignite/'}, {'signal_id': '03792df1e729c0f5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Iran Faces Severe Challenges to Rebuild Missile and Drone Production <p>With the significant Israeli and U.S. military attacks against Iran in 2025 and early 2026, analysts have discussed and debated Iran&#8217;s ability to replenish its missile and drone arsenal. Since 2024, Ira', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/iran-faces-severe-challenges-to-rebuild-missile-and-drone-production/'}, {'signal_id': 'bf95a3eab8eaeec8', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Certainty is a Luxury Ukrainians Must Create <p>Welcome to The Ukraine Compass, a weekly digest of Ukrainian commentary and analysis from across the political spectrum only for War on the Rocks members. Each week, we bring you a curated selection of articles from Ukrainian media ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/certainty-is-a-luxury-ukrainians-must-create/'}, {'signal_id': '34c61349bef94190', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The AI-Assisted Strategic Own Goal in the Kill Chain <p>For eighty years, the Western alliance has anchored its strength in moral legitimacy, shared values, and the resulting credibility to shape international norms. NATO&#8217;s durability through the Cold War rested on more tha', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-ai-assisted-strategic-own-goal-in-the-kill-chain/'}, {'signal_id': '6fd1b54571dd307e', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'China is Watching Us. Is the U.S. Air Force Still Watching China? <p>On Oct. 1, 2026, Beijing celebrated the 77th anniversary of the founding of the People&#8217;s Republic of China and the beginning of the end for the U.S. Air University&#8217;s China Aerospace Studies Institute', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/china-is-watching-us-is-the-u-s-air-force-still-watching-china/'}, {'signal_id': 'f14a768f856c30e1', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'How Closed Airspace Threatens U.S. Military Mobility Across Eurasia <p>For much of the modern aviation era, geography was something the global aviation industry learned to overcome. Simply put, unlike a railway, a pipeline, or a highway, an aircraft does not require a continuous ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/how-closed-airspace-threatens-u-s-military-mobility-across-eurasia/'}, {'signal_id': '232076be356a5cd0', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Cyber Operators Are Deployed in Place. The Pentagon Should Treat Them That Way <p>A cyber operator can spend a shift tracking an adversary halfway around the world, walk to the parking lot, and be home in time for dinner. There is no flight home, no demobilization, and no transit', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cyber-operators-are-deployed-in-place-the-pentagon-should-treat-them-that-way/'}, {'signal_id': 'd83d6b856b81bcf7', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Jaw-Jaw With Belarus, Revisited Amid Ukraine War <p>In 2021, Michael Kimmage wrote, &#8220;Belarus and the Ukraine Trap,&#8221; where he argued the United States should adopt a realistic diplomatic relationship with Belarus that takes into account its strategic partnership with R', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/jaw-jaw-with-belarus-revisited-amid-ukraine-war/'}, {'signal_id': '1f5bf250f385a141', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'MacGyver at Scale: Winning Future Air Wars of Rapid Technological Adaptation <p>During a recent training exercise in the western Pacific, a small group of engineers single-handedly saved the day.In the scenario, adversary covert forces used first-person view drones to intercept A', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/macgyver-at-scale-winning-future-air-wars-of-rapid-technological-adaptation/'}, {'signal_id': 'b47e77fcce435135', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'School of War or School of Battle? Educating for an Uncertain Future <p>In 1901, military analyst Jan Bloch declared that new military technologies had changed war so radically that the study of history had become useless. He castigated military officers who prepared for future w', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/school-of-war-or-school-of-battle-educating-for-an-uncertain-future/'}, {'signal_id': '5e3dd7585228d6c6', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Triumph or Procrastination? Experts Split on the Trump-Xi Summit <p>Over the better part of three days, President Donald Trump hosted Chinese President Xi Jinping in Washington for a summit that drew international attention for its high-stakes agenda, from trade and AI to Taiwan.', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/triumph-or-procrastination-experts-split-on-the-trump-xi-summit/'}, {'signal_id': 'fbaf8edfcbb8e5ad', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Rated Ready is Not Ready: What America’s Korea Exercises Actually Measure <p>&#8220;We want to stop the North Koreans as far from Pusan as we can. Block the main road as far north as possible. Contact General Church. If you can&#8217;t locate him, go to Taejon and beyond if you c', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/rated-ready-is-not-ready-what-americas-korea-exercises-actually-measure/'}, {'signal_id': 'eaa08a7ae327ebc5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Writing the Playbook: A Strategy and Doctrine for American Economic Security <p>In January,