he Rules: Optimizing Weapons Reviews in the Age of Technological Innovation <p>We spare the reader another detailed story from Ukraine to establish the now-familiar point that battlefield technology changes faster than militaries can acquire, review, and field it. The', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/winning-by-the-rules-optimizing-weapons-reviews-in-the-age-of-technological-innovation/'}, {'signal_id': '6b1638584d278fe5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Seoul Needs a Playbook for Hormuz, Ukraine, and What Comes Next <p>Earlier this month, President Donald Trump shared a Washington Post opinion piece on his social media, arguing that South Korea should send its Cheongung-II air-defense system to Ukraine. Additionally, the Trump a', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/seoul-needs-a-playbook-for-hormuz-ukraine-and-what-comes-next/'}, {'signal_id': '9bf925df61fedba8', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'What the End of Operation Inherent Resolve Means for Iraq and Syria <p>Operation Inherent Resolve is scheduled to end on Sept. 30, as remaining U.S. troops in northern Iraq complete their withdrawal. The United States formed Combined Joint Task Force &#8211; Operation Inherent Re', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/what-the-end-of-operation-inherent-resolve-means-for-iraq-and-syria/'}, {'signal_id': 'aadf64d78d30213a', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Missed the Marque: Cyber Privateers Wanted, Compensation to Be Determined <p>Coverage of the new White House memorandum on combating cybercrime quickly reached the privateer label. CNN called the participants &#8220;cyber privateers,&#8221; invoking the image of government-sancti', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/missed-the-marque-cyber-privateers-wanted-compensation-to-be-determined/'}, {'signal_id': '42225fa90d1fc0ae', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Zelensky’s Perception Problem: Are New Partnerships a Solution? <p>Welcome to&#160;The Ukraine Compass, a weekly digest of Ukrainian commentary and analysis from across the political spectrum, only for War on the Rocks&#160;members. Each Monday, we bring you a curated selection o', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/zelenskys-perception-problem-are-new-partnerships-a-solution/'}, {'signal_id': 'd44ca2407cb37de2', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Washington’s Foreign Equity Bets Need Better Governance <p>What do a rare earth mine in Brazil and a graphite mine in Mozambique have in common? Both have received significant United States government funding. The rub? Neither was subject, when the financing was committed, to the', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/washingtons-foreign-equity-bets-need-better-governance/'}, {'signal_id': '6cd84c792977536e', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Only America Could Have Designed the Field Jacket <p>When the M-1943 field jacket was introduced at the height of World War II, it was a revolutionary garment. The jacket was the result of rigorous testing, input from an astonishingly diverse group of experts, and was produced by', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/only-america-could-have-designed-the-field-jacket/'}, {'signal_id': '6fa782126a98f2f9', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Pressure Points <p>Welcome to The Adversarial.&#160;Every other week, we&#8217;ll provide you with expert analysis on America&#8217;s greatest challengers: China, Russia, Iran, North Korea, and jihadists. Read more below.***IranSenior officials from Iran, Oman, and neighboring Gu', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/pressure-points/'}, {'signal_id': 'b35af368cba43d4e', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Why Eurasia, Not the Indo-Pacific, Matters Most in Next Phase of Taiwan Deterrence <p>Washington is preparing for the right war, but in the wrong theater. For years, U.S. strategic thinking has centered on the Indo&#8209;Pacific: the militarized atolls of the South China Sea, Chi', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/why-eurasia-not-the-indo-pacific-matters-most-in-next-phase-of-taiwan-deterrence/'}, {'signal_id': '0dfdfc89ad8a5bd8', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Latin America’s Balancing Act: Washington, Beijing, and the Post-Maduro Environment <p>The year 2026 has brought sweeping change to Latin America&#8217;s relationship with the United States. Following a major military buildup in the Caribbean and strikes against vessels suspected', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/latin-americas-balancing-act-washington-beijing-and-the-post-maduro-environment/'}, {'signal_id': '8944db22e6d28bad', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'A Body Blow? The War on Iran and U.S. Military Readiness <p>The war against Iran is putting new strains on U.S. military readiness by consuming munitions and missile defense interceptors, as well as through extended deployments, sustained operational demands, and the diversion of', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/a-body-blow-the-war-on-iran-and-u-s-military-readiness/'}, {'signal_id': 'cbccfe7292bfa507', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'An Army General Talks Fusing Sensors and Shooters on the Eastern Flank <p>This exclusive Cogs of War interview is with Brig. Gen. Steven P. Carpenter, the commanding general of Multi-Domain Command &#8211; Europe, the U.S. Army&#8217;s first multi-domain operations command, headq', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/an-army-general-talks-fusing-sensors-and-shooters-on-the-eastern-flank/'}, {'signal_id': '14613f43f63d6d48', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Real U.S.-Saudi Nuclear Deal Is Better Than We Thought <p>On Aug. 24, 2026, the Trump administration transmitted the text of the U.S.-Saudi nuclear cooperation agreement to Congress. By doing so, the administration triggered the 90-day congressional review process described i', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-real-u-s-saudi-nuclear-deal-is-better-than-we-thought/'}, {'signal_id': '