2129-e6e5-4f55-bb11-6a2fc061065e/1280x720/match/image.jpg" />lead image</p>', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/11/03/the-armageddon-election-2218009'}, {'signal_id': '678f10e3a59b8cf9', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Haley Stevens caps a bizarre midterm cycle <h3 class="title">Haley Stevens caps a bizarre midterm cycle</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/28bf2cca-4648-4505-aa62-7bf548f10c4c/23a9ecde-ede8-477c-88b1-be627d69cf67/1280x720/match/im', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/11/02/haley-stevens-caps-a-bizarre-midterm-cycle-2217279'}, {'signal_id': '49b90f618cd2bcd1', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': '‘A lot of Republicans have held their tongues’: Anger at Trump is growing Few Republicans are willing to publicly lambast the president. But they’re more blunt in private. <p>Republicans are already privately blaming President Donald Trump as they brace for losses on Tuesday.</p>', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/02/republicans-blame-trump-midterms-2026-01143980'}, {'signal_id': '7013f75615c1ef24', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Democrats eye state supreme court races — this year and beyond National groups are spending money in battleground judicial races with the hope of liberal majorities in two years. <p>Liberal groups have spent millions in a handful of battleground state supreme court races ahead of', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/01/state-supreme-court-midterm-elections-01144147'}, {'signal_id': '0169f96ca0e32dd4', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': "Democratic Rep. Haley Stevens endorses Republican Mike Rogers for Michigan Senate It's a blow for Democratic nominee Abdul El-Sayed in the final days of his campaign, and an escalation of their feud. <p>Democratic Rep. Haley Stevens endorsed Republican Mike Rogers in the Michigan", 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/01/haley-stevens-endorses-mike-rogers-michigan-senate-01144698'}, {'signal_id': '6cfc1bcfbce7293b', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'November 2026 Political cartoons from the desk of Matt Wuerker', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/cartoons/2026/11/01/matt-wuerker-cartoons-november-2026-01144662'}, {'signal_id': '51cb31da408145c8', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The size of Democrats’ victory Tuesday could help determine their future A POLITICO Poll found that Democrats may see a decisive victory as a mandate to run more progressive candidates. <p>For Democrats, the size of their victory matters.</p> \n<p>Progressives and moderates have b', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/01/poll-democratic-party-future-midterms-01141119'}, {'signal_id': '9201ba058492acc7', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Raphael Warnock is \'nauseously optimistic\' about Dem\'s midterm chances <h3 class="title">Raphael Warnock is \'nauseously optimistic\' about Dem\'s midterm chances</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/893eb7b3-731c-47cc-a6ef-02ad223e435', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/11/01/raphael-warnock-is-nauseously-optimistic-about-dems-midterm-chances-2216473'}, {'signal_id': 'da1a21e8f498f658', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'This Sunday, conservative pastors will preach against Democrats’ claims to Christian faith Evangelical pastors in key battlegrounds plan to warn their congregants about the danger of voting Democratic — even for Christian leaders. <p>When Robert Jeffress takes the pulpit at First', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/31/conservative-pastors-sermons-talarico-hamilton-christian-01143604'}, {'signal_id': 'dfcc7a03fa15cf18', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': "El-Sayed campaign wants Stevens to stay away after day of back-and-forth sniping Some Democrats worry that the blowup between the two former primary rivals is imperiling their hold on the seat. <p>TRAVERSE CITY, MICHIGAN — Michigan's Democratic coalition is fragmenting in real ti", 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/30/el-sayed-stevens-senate-race-fight-01144423'}, {'signal_id': '99d7b884caf79827', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': "'A wave can hide a lot of weaknesses': Dems question if they'll learn anything A favorable political environment has allowed the Democratic Party to paper over persistent problems. <p>Democrats are poised for a good night next Tuesday. That doesn’t mean they’ve figured out how to", 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/30/democrats-message-voters-2026-01141508'}, {'signal_id': '324b99a5d7b287a6', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Josh Shapiro aims for a strong finish in a campaign with 2028 implications The Pennsylvania governor has more at stake Tuesday than other 2028 contenders. <p>POCONO RACEWAY, Pennsylvania — High up in the starting stand of a famed race track, Josh Shapiro waves a black-and-white c', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/30/josh-shapiro-campaign-2028-implications-01141906'}, {'signal_id': '5145c8dd8745bbff', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Shapiro takes the inside track <h3 class="title">Shapiro takes the inside track</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/151499bd-182f-4f09-af60-a57e885e66e8/c25538ae-5d27-48df-bf31-0b19e741cf62/1280x720/match/image.jpg" />lead image</p', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/10/30/shapiro-takes-the-inside-track-2215851'}, {'signal_id': '45c7b479386ba8a0', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': '‘It could be quite a brutal evening’: GOP braces for some once-unthinkable losses Some GOP incumbents are still begging for more money in the final stretch. <p>Republicans are bracing for a brutal election night, convinced they’re set to face some previously unthinkable losses in', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/30/republicans-brace-for-losses-2026-midterms-01141576'}, {'signal_id': 'edf45355c6e15134', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The nation’s cartoonists on the week in politics Every week political cartoonists throughout the country and across the political spectrum apply their ink-stained skills to capture the foibles, memes, hypocrisies and other head-slapping events in the world of politics. The fruits', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/gallery/2026/10/30/the-nations-cartoonists-on-the-week-in-politics-01141593'}, {'signal_id': '7ee9c3a76383d2cc', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Poll: Americans don’t trust polls New data from the POLITICO Poll shows just how far the industry has to go to convince a wary public. <p>This just in, according to new poll results: Americans don’t trust polls.</p> \n<p>Only 25% of Americans said political surveys correctly estim', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/30/poll-americans-dont-trust-polls-01141115'}, {'signal_id': 'b619d32cbd4dc6dc', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Why the midterms are a warning sign for both parties <h3 class="title">Why the midterms are a warning sign for both parties</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/446b326a-5964-4398-97c2-d76057918a33/73b887e7-af36-44fa-868b-de1af545b0', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/10/29/why-the-midterms-are-a-warning-sign-for-both-parties-2215580'}, {'signal_id': 'c82aa567504c0e78', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Turning Point rests its reputation on Andy Biggs’ race. It’s not looking good. The group founded by the late Charlie Kirk has thrown big money into the race to boost the last candidate Kirk endorsed before he was killed last year. <p>Turning Point USA has gone all-in to make GOP ', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/29/charlie-kirk-arizona-andy-biggs-turning-point-struggles-01140510'}, {'signal_id': 'c317fbfbd40588d6', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Moderates put the left on notice <h3 class="title">Moderates put the left on notice</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/c22d63de-d311-4016-afc7-281f149a1860/64d51bd1-05ee-43bb-ae3e-12b70ba774a6/1280x720/match/image.jpg" />lead imag', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/10/29/moderates-put-the-left-on-notice-2215191'}, {'signal_id': 'd243dc692bf9f8a1', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'El-Sayed’s allies fear Trump’s anti-Muslim attacks are reaching undecided voters After Trump called him a “jihadist,” Abdul El-Sayed brushed off the “desperate, bad faith attacks” <p>DEARBORN, MICHIGAN — “A threat to America.” “Radical ideology.” “A jihadist.”</p><p>President Don', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/29/trump-muslim-attacks-michigan-el-sayed-01140171'}, {'signal_id': 'e5386d336287102b', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Billionaire taxes, trans rights, abortion, voting rights: This year’s biggest state votes At least $400 million has been spent on TV ads for ballot initiatives this cycle. <p>Statewide ballot measures are flying under the national radar — but some are drawing big spending.</p><p>', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/28/billionaire-taxes-trans-rights-abortion-voting-rights-this-years-biggest-state-votes-01138302'}, {'signal_id': 'b05f872829ed8e77', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Republicans rethink their attacks on AOC <h3 class="title">Republicans rethink their attacks on AOC</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/2e63fb4c-2e39-4801-b4a1-41425e417b10/180a7696-6cef-4df0-bcc2-560710af0ab5/1280x720/match/image.', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/10/28/republicans-rethink-their-attacks-on-aoc-2214551'}, {'signal_id': '8723c13508214ad6', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Midwest Dems face their do or die moment to win back Trump districts before 2028 Voters from western Wisconsin over to southern Minnesota and down to eastern Iowa are hurting. The question is whether they blame the president’s policies enough to elect Democrats. <p>EAU CLAIRE, Wi', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/28/democrats-rural-midwest-rebecca-cooke-01137050'}, {'signal_id': '63eebde12b8bc973', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Republicans wanted Rubio on the stump. Trump coaxed him there. “We love you, Texas,” the secretary of State told the crowd. <p>Secretary of State Marco Rubio on Tuesday came as close to the campaign trail as he’s been all year. And even then, he tried to stay just offshore.</p> \n', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/27/marco-rubio-texas-trump-midterms-01137437'}, {'signal_id': '9a9c09e400e51d20', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Trump is still the center of the GOP money universe <h3 class="title">Trump is still the center of the GOP money universe</h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/00800ebb-3e0d-4bf6-a65d-4cd5b71d8b4b/9232b4d1-b0a5-4c17-b06c-09dfb577e60f', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/10/27/trump-is-still-the-center-of-the-gop-money-universe-2213216'}, {'signal_id': '7615818dcb86ca79', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'Kathy Hochul on Trump, Mamdani and the future of New York <h3 class="title">Kathy Hochul on Trump, Mamdani and the future of New York </h3> \n<p><img src="https://cf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net/v1/static/1155968404/8a10fb45-3994-42c6-8457-34e286d88af7/99b3a103-8902-4b0a-a060', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/video/2026/10/27/kathy-hochul-on-trump-mamdani-and-the-future-of-new-york-2212608'}, {'signal_id': '106eeeb853208e6c', 'source': 'politico', 'text_snippet': 'The hidden GOP fundraising weakness is getting worse Republican candidates’ struggles with online fundraising have left them more reliant on large donors and super PACs. <p>Republicans’ small-dollar donor base has contracted in recent years, leaving the party more dependent on a ', 'url': 'https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/27/trump-gop-online-fundraising-problems-01135716'}], 'source_metadata': [{'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 100, 'first_seen': '2026-11-03T09:00:36+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-09-09T17:30:23+00:00'}, {'source': 'cipher_brief', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 30, 'first_seen': '2026-11-03T10:00:06+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-10-14T12:46:56+00:00'}, {'source': 'just_security', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 10, 'first_seen': '2026-11-03T14:29:56+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-11-02T13:51:04+00:00'}, {'source': 'rand', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 20, 'first_seen': '2026-11-02T22:45:00+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-09-02T17:30:00+00:00'}, {'source': 'atlantic_council', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 100, 'first_seen': '2026-11-03T16:00:00+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-10-21T18:24:03+00:00'}, {'source': 'defense_one', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 19, 'first_seen': '2026-11-02T23:00:00+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-10-23T00:30:31+00:00'}, {'source': '38_north', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 8, 'first_seen': '2026-11-03T14:02:47+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-10-20T19:05:34+00:00'}, {'source': 'nk_news', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 300, 'first_seen': '2026-11-03T09:21:44+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-08-11T07:15:55+00:00'}, {'source': 'csis_korea', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 10, 'first_seen': '2026-08-19T16:43:50+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-02-02T06:37:23+00:00'}, {'source': 'yonhap', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 96, 'first_seen': '2026-11-03T19:46:55+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-11-02T21:47:42+00:00'}, {'source': 'lawfare', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 5, 'first_seen': '2026-11-03T18:00:03+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-11-02T20:17:31+00:00'}, {'source': 'propublica', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 20, 'first_seen': '2026-11-03T11:00:00+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026-10-23T16:00:00+00:00'}, {'source': 'politico', 'credibility_score': 0.7, 'signal_count': 30, 'first_seen': '2026-11-03T17:00:00+00:00', 'last_seen': '2026